    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I rundi ma Tartan ubino ba Acdod, kinde ma Sargon m’ubimo mir Ascur uore, man ekiedo kum Acdod emake de; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i nindo maeca Yehova yero ku dhu Isaya ma wod Amoz, ewacu kumae, Cidhi, man igony gonia kud i pieri, man ikab wara peri kud i tiendi. E etimo kumeca, m’ewotho ko muneru ma tiende nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova wacu kumae, Calu jatic para ma Isaya wotho muneru man umbe wara rundi adek ni giranyutha ku musana pi Misiri man pir Ethiopia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e ubimo mir Ascur bicidho ku dhanu mi ng’eca mi Misiri kumeca, ku dhanu ma judaku mir Ethiopia, ju m’aradu ku ju m’uti, muneru man umbe wara, man ku thegi ma ngbeng’, ni lewic mi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E cwinygi biringo man cwinygi bing’abre, kum Ethiopia ma genogen migi, man kum Misiri ma dwong’ migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atu m’ubedo dhu wath maeni biwacu ceng’ maeca kumae, Nen, genogen mwa kumeni, ka ma waringo i ie mi kony kara jubodhwa ni ubimo mir Ascur: e wan, wabiboth nenedi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
